"P1580463753" "Ah yes.  Good.  You read up, did you?  Great.  Now, let's see that Manual.  I hope you've got it memorized!  Good job.  <br><br>This next part is going to be fun!  You're going to create something using the workbenches!  See that workbench over there?  Go over and build yourself an Enhancement.  Here is everything you will need to build it, including the Salvage from Professor Boram's class, a Common Recipe, and a bit of Influence to pay for the Workbench."

